(INGREDIA PRIVACY POLICY) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Last updated: August 28, 2026) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Ingredia is an iPhone app that helps users review packaged food products against a ) Tj
T*
(personal allergy or intolerance profile.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This privacy policy describes what information the app uses, where that information is ) Tj
T*
(stored, and when data is sent to external services.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(INFORMATION STORED ON DEVICE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Ingredia stores the following information locally on the user’s device:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• allergy and intolerance selections) Tj
T*
(• profile name) Tj
T*
(• cross-contamination preference) Tj
T*
(• optional restaurant note) Tj
T*
(• selected app language) Tj
T*
(• scanned product history) Tj
T*
(• product records saved after scan or review) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This information is used to personalize product assessments and keep previously viewed ) Tj
T*
(products available in the app.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CAMERA ACCESS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Ingredia requests camera access only to scan product barcodes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The app does not use the camera to record video for upload or background monitoring.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NETWORK REQUESTS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(When a user scans a barcode, Ingredia sends the barcode to Open Food Facts to retrieve ) Tj
T*
(product information.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Ingredia may also send product category information in requests to search for ) Tj
T*
(alternative items in similar categories.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(These requests are used only to:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• fetch product records) Tj
T*
(• look for similar products) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
