(• update the displayed assessment) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXTERNAL DATA SOURCE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Ingredia currently uses Open Food Facts as an external product data source.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Open Food Facts is a third-party public database. Product information returned by that ) Tj
T*
(service can be incomplete, outdated, or incorrect.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Users should always verify the product packaging and the manufacturer’s latest ) Tj
T*
(information.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(PERSONAL DATA SHARING) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Ingredia does not intentionally send the user’s full allergy profile, restaurant note, ) Tj
T*
(or scan history to Open Food Facts as named profile records.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(However, the app uses the profile locally to evaluate fetched product data and to rank ) Tj
T*
(alternative suggestions on device.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ANALYTICS AND TRACKING) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The current version of Ingredia does not include:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• advertising SDKs) Tj
T*
(• third-party analytics SDKs) Tj
T*
(• cross-app tracking) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If analytics, crash reporting, or account features are added later, this policy should ) Tj
T*
(be updated before release of those changes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(DATA RETENTION) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Local data remains on the device until the user deletes the app or clears that data ) Tj
T*
(through future app controls.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(At the current stage, scan history and saved product records remain available locally ) Tj
T*
(for reuse inside the app.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CHILDREN) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Ingredia is not designed specifically for children under a defined age threshold, and it) Tj
T*
( does not knowingly collect personal information from children through account creation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SAFETY LIMITATION) Tj
ET
endstream
